# Same line endings on every machine: LF in the repository AND in working trees,
# so a clone on Windows, Linux or macOS produces identical files (and identical
# hashes for the files that must match Waveshare's originals, see firmware/NOTICE.md).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Genuinely binary assets (none today; listed so future images/fonts are never "fixed" by git).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
